⍝ benchmark: SHA-256 of 100 MiB (1 MiB of generated bytes, hashed 100 times over as one message)
⍝ Authored with the s2 shorthands (trith/s2/tools/trx.py); sha256.trh is generated by make bench-regen.
⍝ Words are 32-bit values held in ℤ, masked after every addition.

⍝ The Σ and σ functions rotate x by shifting y = x with a copy of itself in the high half:
⍝ bits 0…31 of y ≫ n are x rotated right by n, so three rotations cost three shifts and one mask
⦃ ⧖:x ⧗:x ⧗:x #32# ≪ ⋓ ⧖:y ⧗:y #2# ≫ ⧗:y #13# ≫ ⩡ ⧗:y #22# ≫ ⩡ #4294967295# ⋒ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹bsig0› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:x ⧗:x ⧗:x #32# ≪ ⋓ ⧖:y ⧗:y #6# ≫ ⧗:y #11# ≫ ⩡ ⧗:y #25# ≫ ⩡ #4294967295# ⋒ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹bsig1› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:x ⧗:x ⧗:x #32# ≪ ⋓ ⧖:y ⧗:y #7# ≫ ⧗:y #18# ≫ ⩡ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:x #3# ≫ ⩡ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ssig0› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:x ⧗:x ⧗:x #32# ≪ ⋓ ⧖:y ⧗:y #17# ≫ ⧗:y #19# ≫ ⩡ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:x #10# ≫ ⩡ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ssig1› ⸫
⍝ ‹ch› e f g: f where e has ones, g elsewhere; ‹maj› a b c: the majority of each bit
⦃ ⧖:e,f,g ⧗:g ⧗:e ⧗:f ⧗:g ⩡ ⋒ ⩡ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹ch› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:a,b,c ⧗:a ⧗:b ⋒ ⧗:c ⧗:a ⧗:b ⋓ ⋒ ⋓ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹maj› ⸫

⍝ ‹byte› m i: byte i of the message (centre-based index), as 0…255
⦃ ⌖̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⚇ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹byte› ⸫
⍝ ‹at› a t: word t of a 65-slot table whose slot 0 is a seed (word t sits at index t − 31)
⦃ #-31# ⊞ ⌖̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹at› ⸫

⍝ ‹load› w m p: the block of 64 bytes from index p, as big-endian words 0…15 of w.
⍝ The prayers state the lengths of the message and the schedule (§12)
⦃
  ⍤² ⦃ ⌁ ⍴̱ #1048577# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊖ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⍤³ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⍴̱ #65# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊖ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ○ ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:w,m,p,i
    ⧗:p ⧗:i #4# ⊠ ⊞ ⧖:q
    ⧗:w ⟖ ⧗:i #-31# ⊞
    ⧗:m ⧗:q ‹byte› #24# ≪
    ⧗:m ⧗:q △ ⊞ ‹byte› #16# ≪ ⋓
    ⧗:m ⧗:q #2# ⊞ ‹byte› #8# ≪ ⋓
    ⧗:m ⧗:q #3# ⊞ ‹byte› ⋓
    ⍈̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
    ⧗:m ⧗:p ⧗:i △ ⊞ #16# ⍿¹ ≶
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹load› ⸫

⍝ ‹extend› w: the message schedule, words 16…63 from words 0…15
⦃
  ⍤¹ ⦃ ⍴̱ #65# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊖ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  #16# ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:w,t
    ⧗:w ⟗ ⧗:t #2# ⊟ ‹at› ‹ssig1› ⧖:a
    ⟗ ⧗:t #7# ⊟ ‹at› ⧖:b
    ⟗ ⧗:t #15# ⊟ ‹at› ‹ssig0› ⧖:c
    ⟗ ⧗:t #16# ⊟ ‹at› ⧖:d
    ⟖ ⧗:t #-31# ⊞ ⧗:a ⧗:b ⊞ ⧗:c ⊞ ⧗:d ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⍈̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
    ⧗:t △ ⊞ #64# ⍿¹ ≶
  ⦄
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹extend› ⸫

⍝ ‹rounds› w k a b c d e f g h: the 64 rounds over the schedule w and the constants k
⦃
  ⍤⁹ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⍴̱ #65# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊖ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ⍤¹⁰ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁̱ ⍴̱ #65# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊖ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
  ○ ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:w,k,a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,t
    ⧗:h ⧗:e ‹bsig1› ⊞ ⧗:e ⧗:f ⧗:g ‹ch› ⊞ ⧗:k ⧗:t ‹at› ⊞ ⧗:w ⧗:t ‹at› ⊞ ⧖:t1
    ⧗:a ‹bsig0› ⧗:a ⧗:b ⧗:c ‹maj› ⊞ ⧖:t2
    ⧗:w ⧗:k
    ⧗:t1 ⧗:t2 ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:a ⧗:b ⧗:c
    ⧗:d ⧗:t1 ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:e ⧗:f ⧗:g
    ⧗:t △ ⊞ #64# ⍿¹ ≶
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:x0,x1,x2,x3,x4,x5,x6,x7 ⌁̱ ⌁̱
  ⧗:x0 ⧗:x1 ⧗:x2 ⧗:x3 ⧗:x4 ⧗:x5 ⧗:x6 ⧗:x7
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rounds› ⸫

⍝ ‹compress› w k h0…h7: the hash state after the block loaded in w
⦃
  ⧖:w,k,h0,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,h7
  ⧗:w ‹extend› ⟗ ⧗:k ⧗:h0 ⧗:h1 ⧗:h2 ⧗:h3 ⧗:h4 ⧗:h5 ⧗:h6 ⧗:h7 ‹rounds›
  ⧖:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h
  ⧗:h0 ⧗:a ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:h1 ⧗:b ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:h2 ⧗:c ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:h3 ⧗:d ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒
  ⧗:h4 ⧗:e ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:h5 ⧗:f ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:h6 ⧗:g ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒ ⧗:h7 ⧗:h ⊞ #4294967295# ⋒
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹compress› ⸫

⍝ ‹pad› w: the final block of a message of 838860800 bits (a whole number of blocks):
⍝ a one bit, zeros, and the length
⦃
  ⟖ #-31# #2147483648# ⍈̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
  △ ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:w,i
    ⧗:w ⟖ ⧗:i #-31# ⊞ ○ ⍈̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
    ⧗:i △ ⊞ #15# ⍿¹ ≶
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⟖ #-16# #838860800# ⍈̱ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pad› ⸫

⦃
  ⍝ 1 MiB of bytes from a linear congruential generator, after a seed byte
  $x$ ○ #42# ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:s,i,x
    ⧗:x #1103515245# ⊠ #12345# ⊞ #2147483647# ⋒ ⧖:y
    ⧗:s ⧗:y #16# ≫ ⍆̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:y #1048576# ⍿² ≶
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⟗
  ⟦ ○
    #1116352408# #1899447441# #3049323471# #3921009573# #961987163# #1508970993# #2453635748# #2870763221#
    #3624381080# #310598401# #607225278# #1426881987# #1925078388# #2162078206# #2614888103# #3248222580#
    #3835390401# #4022224774# #264347078# #604807628# #770255983# #1249150122# #1555081692# #1996064986#
    #2554220882# #2821834349# #2952996808# #3210313671# #3336571891# #3584528711# #113926993# #338241895#
    #666307205# #773529912# #1294757372# #1396182291# #1695183700# #1986661051# #2177026350# #2456956037#
    #2730485921# #2820302411# #3259730800# #3345764771# #3516065817# #3600352804# #4094571909# #275423344#
    #430227734# #506948616# #659060556# #883997877# #958139571# #1322822218# #1537002063# #1747873779#
    #1955562222# #2024104815# #2227730452# #2361852424# #2428436474# #2756734187# #3204031479# #3329325298#
  ⟧ ⟗
  ⍝ the schedule: a seed slot and 64 words
  ⟦ ○ ⟧ ○ ⥀ ⦃ ⧖:w,i ⧗:w ○ ⍆̵ ⧗:i △ ⊞ #64# ⍿¹ ≶ ⦄ ⌁
  ⍝ the stack is now [bytes, its shadow, constants, their shadow, schedule]; ⍿ reaches the shadows
  ⍝ the 1,638,400 blocks: block n is block n mod 16384 of the generated bytes (byte 0 at index −524287)
  #1779033703# #3144134277# #1013904242# #2773480762# #1359893119# #2600822924# #528734635# #1541459225# ○ ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:w,h0,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,h7,n
    ⧗:w ⍿³ ⧗:n #16383# ⋒ #64# ⊠ #-524287# ⊞ ‹load›
    ⍿¹ ⧗:h0 ⧗:h1 ⧗:h2 ⧗:h3 ⧗:h4 ⧗:h5 ⧗:h6 ⧗:h7 ‹compress›
    ⧗:n △ ⊞ #1638400# ⍿¹ ≶
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⧖:z0,z1,z2,z3,z4,z5,z6,z7 ‹pad› ⍿¹ ⧗:z0 ⧗:z1 ⧗:z2 ⧗:z3 ⧗:z4 ⧗:z5 ⧗:z6 ⧗:z7 ‹compress›
  ⧖:h0,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,h7 ⌁̵ ⌁̱ ⌁̵ ⌁̱
  ⧗:h0 ⎙ ⧗:h1 ⎙ ⧗:h2 ⎙ ⧗:h3 ⎙ ⧗:h4 ⎙ ⧗:h5 ⎙ ⧗:h6 ⎙ ⧗:h7 ⎙
  ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
